      <dd class="ml-6 text-muted-foreground"><p>Specifies the type of proc mount to use for the containers. The <code>unmasked</code> value ensures that a container’s <code>/proc</code> file system is mounted as read/write by the container process. The default is <code>Default</code>. This value is optional.</p></dd>
